Package: mayo-calculator
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libsdl3-0, libfreetype6, libgl1, libfontconfig1, libdbus-1-3, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: libvulkan1
Description: macOS-style calculator for Pulsar OS (Mayonnaise)
 Basic and scientific keypads with operator precedence, parentheses, memory,
 2nd functions, degrees/radians, macOS-style percentages
 (50 + 10 % = 55), repeated equals, keyboard/numpad input and locale-grouped
 numbers. Drawn with the Mayonnaise C++20 UI toolkit on SDL3, using Vulkan
 when the GPU supports it and OpenGL otherwise.
